      "text": "𝐓𝐑𝐀𝐅𝐅𝐈𝐂 𝐀𝐃𝐕𝐈𝐒𝐎𝐑𝐘: The Department of Public Works and Highways (DPWH) is set to undertake a rehabilitation of Magallanes Flyover northbound along Epifanio Delos Santos Avenue in Makati City during nighttime starting 11 p.m. tonight, June 20, until 5 a.m. on June 23.\n\nMotorists are advised to take alternate routes:\n\n• Magallanes Flyover NB (Pasay-Cubao) Lane 1, Abut A. to Pier 2\n• Magallanes Flyover NB (Pasay-Cubao) Lane 1, Pier 3 to Pier 6\n• Magallanes Flyover NB (Pasay-Cubao) Lane 2, Abut A. to Pier 2\n• Magallanes Flyover NB (Pasay-Cubao) Lane 1, Pier 7 to Pier 9\n• Magallanes Flyover NB (Pasay-Cubao) Lane 1, Pier 3 to Pier 6\n\n#mmda",
